{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By adding <i>Songs Without Loneliness</i> to your wishlist, you\u2019re helping us speed up the game\u2019s release :)<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700850/extras/41828c6434ac2f667d67e2381774cbdb.avif?t=1767551006\" width=1000 height=600 /></span><strong></strong><br><strong></strong><br><strong><br>The sounds listen to you. This is how YOUR nightmare begins.</strong><br><strong></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You are an engineer sent to the remote LammyComplex to restore the facility\u2019s main entertainment mascot \u2014 Lammy. What starts as a simple maintenance task quickly turns into a nightmare as the situation spirals out of control.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700850/extras/b16bc5caf61217469047c27e90a8163e.avif?t=1767551006\" width=800 height=480 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Songs Without Loneliness</i></strong> is a first-person indie horror game focused on atmosphere, tension, and subtle storytelling. Explore the abandoned complex, uncover clues from the past, and try to escape the darkness before it consumes you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd27 Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story-driven single-player experience</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Retro-tech horror atmosphere</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Minimal UI for maximum immersion</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Light puzzles and survival elements</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A mysterious mascot with a hidden past</strong></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackgroun